{
  "email": "jinipatel@gmail.com"
}

### VERIFY OTP
POST http://localhost:5000/api/forgot-password/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jinipatel@gmail.com",
  "otp": ""
}

### CHANGE PASSWORD
